# The build context is the repo root, for the pnpm workspace and lockfile. Keep it small.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.lighthouseci
docs
content
# apps/web is not built into this image, but pnpm needs its manifest to honour the lockfile.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
